    - target: {fileID: 114691560281445598, guid: 3de2ef7384d527c4b945f960643ef6e2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: text
      value: 'CheckPoints work with the Respawner



        When an Animal enters
        a CheckPoint, the Respawner will take this position and rotation, and It
        will save in the Respawner the Last State the animal had.

        E.g: If
        the Animal was [Swiming] when he touched this CheckPoint the next time the
        animal dies;  it will Respawn on this Check Point Position and he will be
        starting with the Swim State'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: 3de2ef7384d527c4b945f960643ef6e2, type: 3}
